  ],
  "notes": "Manual/inbound and all three response styles converge on one physical carrier rupture. The contact choice belongs inside the failure. Scene sourceId hooks own staging and audio; no line cue or generic scream is authored. Both choices permanently lose the carrier.",
  "regions": [
    {
      "id": "radio.pre_third_room_breakdown.entrances",
      "title": "Martin at the desk",
      "kind": "branch",
      "color": "#245c62",
